@startuml
title BitChat Bridge - BLE to Mesh and Mesh to BLE

actor "BitChat App" as App
participant "BitChat BLE\nCharacteristic" as BLE
participant "BitChatBridgeModule" as Bridge
participant "Router" as Router
participant "MeshService" as Service
participant "LoRa Mesh" as Mesh
participant "Remote BitChatBridgeModule" as RemoteBridge

== BLE -> Mesh ==
App -> BLE : Write BitChat frame
BLE -> Bridge : handleBleWrite(data)
Bridge -> Bridge : parse + dedupe + TTL handling
Bridge -> Router : allocForSending()
Router --> Bridge : meshtastic_MeshPacket
Bridge -> Service : sendToMesh(PRIVATE_APP + BCHT)
Service -> Mesh : transmit

== Mesh -> BLE ==
Mesh -> RemoteBridge : receive PRIVATE_APP + BCHT
RemoteBridge -> RemoteBridge : parse + dedupe
RemoteBridge -> BLE : notify(serialized BitChat frame)
BLE -> App : BitChat frame delivered

== Announcements ==
Bridge -> Bridge : createPeerAnnouncement()
note over Bridge
Nickname truncation is UTF-8-safe,
so multibyte characters (for example
Ukrainian symbols) are not split.
end note
Bridge -> BLE : periodic announce notify

@enduml
